       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. LNKB.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-TID        PIC X(4) VALUE 'T002'.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 DFHCOMMAREA.
          05 LK-NEXT    PIC X(8).
          05 LK-DATA    PIC X(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN.
           IF LK-DATA = 'Y'
               EXEC CICS XCTL PROGRAM(LK-NEXT) COMMAREA(DFHCOMMAREA)
               END-EXEC
           END-IF.
           EXEC CICS RETURN TRANSID(WS-TID) COMMAREA(DFHCOMMAREA)
           END-EXEC.
